Stored parser archives (10-26): the dashboard checks of 11, 12, 13 and 14 parse these instead of running FF.
golden-B (50) and golden-C (52) keep the fresh FF -> parser wiring in --full.

Drift check (50, --full): every .tgz here (not 12_old_v2) is compared with the fresh golden-B bundle: member names
(host paths folded; excluded.txt and unreachable.txt may be missing), header lines, metadata keys. When it FAILs with
"bundle format changed": FF's bundle changed; remake the archives with tools/mkbundles.sh into a new directory, rerun
11-14 on them, then swap them in and update the commit below.

